CVPR-2023-P0387,CVPR-2023-A002077,Xinlong Wang,shared,3,5,5,"Peking University Task prompts Paintings Input images Painter Figure . An illustration of the in-context inference of Painter. Painter is a generalist vision model, which can automatically perform vision tasks according to the input task prompts without the task specific heads. Painter can not only perform in-domain tasks with highly competitive performance, such as semantic segmentation (Row ), instance segmentation (Row ), depth estimation (Row ), keypoint detection (Row ), denoising (Row ), deraining (Row ), and image enhancement (Row7), but also be able to rapidly adapt to various out-of-domain vision tasks using simple prompts, such as open-category object segmentation, keypoint detection, and instance segmentation (Row - ).",-2,data/raw/cvpr/2023/first_pages/CVPR-2023-P0387.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/papers/Wang_Images_Speak_in_Images_A_Generalist_Painter_for_In-Context_Visual_CVPR_2023_paper.pdf
