CVPR-2023-P1097,CVPR-2023-A005817,Muheng Li,shared,3,4,4,"Department of Automation, Tsinghua University Department of Electronic Engineering, Tsinghua University A chair with straight legs. A straight chair. A ball-shaped A sofa with revolving chair. curving legs. A two-layered triangular table. An artistic chair. Text-to-Shape Generation A sofa. Incomplete Shape A chair with curving legs. Text-Guided Shape Completion Text-Guided Shape Manipulation Figure . We propose a text-to-shape synthesis approach named Diffusion-SDF. Our method is capable of performing various text-to-shape tasks including text-to-shape generation (directly generating 3D shapes from texts), text-guided shape completion (generating the missing part of an incomplete shape under the guidance of texts), and text-guided shape manipulation (modifying a given shape according to texts).",-5,data/raw/cvpr/2023/first_pages/CVPR-2023-P1097.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/papers/Li_Diffusion-SDF_Text-To-Shape_via_Voxelized_Diffusion_CVPR_2023_paper.pdf
