CVPR-2023-P1463,CVPR-2023-A007837,Xianggang Yu,shared,3,13,13,"equal technical contribution part of project lead FNii, CUHKSZ corresponding author SSE, CUHKSZ .cn/projects/MVImgNet Figure . It is time to embrace MVImgNet! We introduce MVImgnet, a large-scale dataset of multi-view images, which is efficiently collected by shooting videos of real-world objects. It enjoys 3D-aware signals from multi-view consistency, being a soft bridge between 2D and 3D vision. Through dense reconstruction on MVImgNet, we also present a large-scale real-world 3D object point cloud dataset – MVPNet. Exterior: Examples of various multi-view images in MVImgNet (see Fig. more intuitively). Interior: Instances of colorful point clouds from MVPNet (see Fig. more clearly) are assembled into a stereo sign of ‘MVImgNet’.",-16,data/raw/cvpr/2023/first_pages/CVPR-2023-P1463.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/papers/Yu_MVImgNet_A_Large-Scale_Dataset_of_Multi-View_Images_CVPR_2023_paper.pdf
