CVPR-2023-P1940,CVPR-2023-A010323,Hadi Alzayer,shared,3,7,7,"Google Ultra-wide University of Maryland, College Park Wide Refocused Input Deblurred Our results Shallow DoF Figure . Post-capture depth-of-field (DoF) control from dual camera. (Left) Using photos captured from dual cameras with a wide field of view (FoV) and ultra-wide FoV, our method enables various DoF manipulations. (Right) We showcase our results of refocusing (changing the focal plane), deblurring (creating all-in-focus imagery), and synthesizing a shallower DoF (producing bokeh effects).",0,data/raw/cvpr/2023/first_pages/CVPR-2023-P1940.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/papers/Alzayer_DC2_Dual-Camera_Defocus_Control_by_Learning_To_Refocus_CVPR_2023_paper.pdf
