CVPR-2023-P2065,CVPR-2023-A011016,Nataniel Ruiz,shared,3,6,6,"Google Research Boston University Figure . With just a few images (typically - ) of a subject (left), DreamBooth—our AI-powered photo booth—can generate a myriad of images of the subject in different contexts (right), using the guidance of a text prompt. The results exhibit natural interactions with the environment, as well as novel articulations and variation in lighting conditions, all while maintaining high fidelity to the key visual features of the subject.",0,data/raw/cvpr/2023/first_pages/CVPR-2023-P2065.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/papers/Ruiz_DreamBooth_Fine_Tuning_Text-to-Image_Diffusion_Models_for_Subject-Driven_Generation_CVPR_2023_paper.pdf
